<div class="download-workspace" data-download-workspace>
<section class="panel gallery-context">
<%= render 'context_heading', title: 'Lunine mene in datumi', expand: 'Razširi pregled' %>
<div class="context-content" id="gallery-context-content"><%= render 'year_selector' %><div class="link-grid compact"><% available_months=Page.where(path:(1..12).map { |m| month_url(@year,m,'lunin-koledar') }).pluck(:month); available_months.sort.each do |m| %><a href="<%= month_url(@year,m,'lunin-koledar') %>"><%= CalendarEngine::MONTHS[m-1] %></a><% end %></div><% from=Time.zone.local(@year,@page.month||1,1);to=@page.month ? from.next_month : from.next_year;phases=AstronomicalEvent.where(kind:'moon',instant:from...to).order(:instant);phases=phases.where(title:'mlaj') if page_path=='/mlaj/';phases=phases.where(title:'ščip (polna luna)') if page_path=='/polna-luna/' %><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table" aria-label="Lunine mene v slovenskem času in UTC"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Datum v Sloveniji</th><th scope="col">Ura</th><th scope="col">Lunina mena</th><th scope="col">UTC</th></tr></thead><tbody><% phases.each do |a| %><tr><td><%= sl_date(a.local_time) %></td><td><%= a.local_time.strftime('%H:%M %Z') %></td><td><%= a.title %></td><td><%= a.instant.utc.strftime('%d. %m. %H:%M') %></td></tr><% end %></tbody></table></div><p>Časi astronomskih men so preračunani iz UTC v časovni pas Europe/Ljubljana, vključno s premikom datuma in poletnim časom. <a href="https://aa.usno.navy.mil/data/MoonPhases">Vir: USNO</a>.</p><p>Koledar opisuje astronomske pojave. Iz njega ne izhajajo napovedi o zdravju, sreči ali uspehu pri vrtnarjenju.</p></div></section><%= render 'designs',type:'lunar' %></div>
